\ ***************************************************************************
\ System: the keyboard and the sound chip, straight from the System VIA
\ (after chuckie-egg-2-beeb's system.6502 and sound.6502), so the game makes
\ no OS calls once it's running.
\ ***************************************************************************

\ Is a key down? X = internal key number. Z clear (BNE) if it is. (The
\ music's interrupt can land in the middle of this, and puts the port
\ back as it found it: music.6502.)
.key_down
    LDA #&7F : STA sysvia_ddra      ; bits 0-6 the key, bit 7 its state
    LDA #3 : STA sysvia_orb         ; auto-scan off: the matrix is ours
    STX sysvia_ora_nh
    LDA sysvia_ora_nh : AND #&80
    RTS

\ (sound_write, which the title page's music uses too, is in chip.6502.)
INCLUDE "chip.6502"
